name: reviewify
description: >
  Use when reviewing a branch or PR since a fixed point, before /stage when a
  spec path is known, after a major task, or when asking whether the diff
  matches standards and the originating spec. Not for brainstorming (no diff)
  or whole-repo architecture survey (architectify).
