    71	        never returns: a failed release leaves the lock live for up to its TTL,
    72	        so every later poll refuses while this run claims success (G0B3-11)."""
    73	        if self.lost:
    74	            # G-LOCK-6: never release a lease we no longer own -- the lock file
    75	            # under our name may now belong to the run that reclaimed it.
